&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;作者：&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6591621&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608541381&quot; alt=&quot;Confucian Lee&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6591621)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee&quot;  &gt;Confucian Lee&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;且听，这是来自大唐的末曲。&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;狂风，啸纸喷墨-艺术作品合集&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/happystormzhangart&quot;&gt;至狂风呼啸处 风的艺作&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶————————————————————————————————————————————————————◀&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/h-storm-z&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4761754&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608541381&quot; alt=&quot;H-Storm Z&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4761754)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/h-storm-z&quot;  &gt;H-Storm Z&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;：请将你的一切倾诉写在信纸中，风会聆听。&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
在恭喜风风喜提人事页的同时，我开始思考为什么自己到现在还没有人事页，难道是我不会写小短篇的原因？——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6331978&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608541381&quot; alt=&quot;carter lu&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6331978)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu&quot;  &gt;carter lu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
你鸽了一年来着吧&amp;#8230;——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/artcgb&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4847732&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608541381&quot; alt=&quot;ARtcgb&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4847732)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/artcgb&quot;  &gt;ARtcgb&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
恭喜风风喜提人事！我的还遥遥无期……（哭）——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6591621&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608541381&quot; alt=&quot;Confucian Lee&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6591621)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee&quot;  &gt;Confucian Lee&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
